{"id": "34531", "title": "刁蛮千金闯情路(楚氏兄妹)", "author": "陈美琳", "category": "文学名著", "count": 35, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34531.htm", "intro": "哼！男人！果真是有了异性，没了人性！？她那庄主哥哥一娶了妻子，就不要她这个妹妹；他居然说要「随便」找个婆家把她给嫁了……随便？她岂是这么随便的一个姑娘家吗？说嫁就嫁！？那可不！谁不知道她心里打开始就只有那个酷酷的聂平！可，聂平这傢伙也实在酷得太过火了吧？他明知道她一直在等他，却是一年半载也没见着个只字片语的！什么嘛！大夥儿到底拿她当什么看？简直是……气死她了！她非得让他们忙得鸡飞狗跳不可！逃家？嗯！好像是个不错的主意！盘缠是不多，不过她可以捉大盗领赏金；虽然这大盗好像……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34531", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2190612.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2190613.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2190614.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2190615.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2190616.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2190617.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2190618.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2190619.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2190620.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2190621.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2190622.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2190623.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2190624.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2190625.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2190626.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2190627.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2190628.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2190629.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2190630.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2190631.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2190632.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2190633.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2190634.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2190635.html", "available": false}, {"title": "